Package: habitv
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Habitv Maintainers <https://github.com/Mika3578/habitv>
Homepage: https://github.com/Mika3578/habitv
Description: Automatic French TV replay downloader
 Habitv watches selected replay categories and downloads new episodes.
 .
 This package installs Habitv under /opt/habitv and provides a habitv
 launcher on PATH. A Java 8 runtime with JavaFX support is required and
 is not bundled with this package.
